'''Shozers''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with pale-[[color]]ed skin and black [[eye]]s. The [[Resistance]] [[technician]] [[Goss Toowers]] was a member of the species.<ref name="Goss Toowers" /> [[Krel Noviip]] battled against the crumbling [[Galactic Empire]] during the [[Iron Blockade|Uprising]] in the [[Anoat sector]], shortly after the second [[DS-2 Death Star II Mobile Battle Station|Death Star]] was [[Battle of Endor|destroyed]].<ref name="Uprising">''[[Star Wars: Uprising]]''</ref>

